<sheet>
<description>MODULO / ALIMENTACION / ARRANQUE</description>
<plain>
<wire x1="0" y1="0" x2="406.4" y2="0" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="406.4" y1="0" x2="406.4" y2="254" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="406.4" y1="254" x2="0" y2="254" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="0" y1="254" x2="0" y2="0" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<text x="7.62" y="243.84" size="3" layer="97">ROBOTRACERS 2026  |  ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8</text>
<text x="7.62" y="236.22" size="2" layer="97">MODULO / ALIMENTACION / ARRANQUE</text>
<text x="7.62" y="5.08" size="1.6" layer="97">REV E | 2026-09-27 | ESP32 INTEGRADA EN ROBOT 2S</text>
<text x="12.7" y="91.44" size="1.6" layer="97">GPIO35/36/37: sin conexion externa (PSRAM).</text>
<text x="12.7" y="81.28" size="1.6" layer="97">GPIO0/3/45/46: respetar strapping al reset.</text>
<text x="12.7" y="71.12" size="1.6" layer="97">GPIO19/20: USB. GPIO21: presencia USB (activo bajo).</text>
<text x="12.7" y="60.96" size="1.6" layer="97">GPIO43: latch regleta GPIO44: boton S3. UART0 reasignada.</text>
<text x="12.7" y="50.8" size="1.6" layer="97">Antena al borde. Mantener despeje de 15 mm.</text>
<text x="12.7" y="40.64" size="1.6" layer="97">GND comun; pad termico con vias a plano GND.</text>
<text x="198.12" y="231.14" size="2" layer="97">01  |  ENTRADA 3,3 V Y DESACOPLO LOCAL</text>
<text x="198.12" y="180.34" size="1.6" layer="97">Alimentacion desde TPS62933 (hoja 3): 3.3 V; desacoplo local C1/C2.</text>
<text x="198.12" y="170.18" size="1.6" layer="97">Colocar C1/C2 junto al pin 2. No conectar VBAT/5 V.</text>
<text x="198.12" y="154.94" size="2" layer="97">02  |  RESET CON SUPERVISION DE TENSION</text>
<text x="254" y="81.28" size="1.45" layer="97">U2: 3,08 V / 200 ms; R5 limita descarga de C3.</text>
<text x="198.12" y="66.04" size="2" layer="97">03  |  BOOT Y ESTADOS DE ARRANQUE</text>
</plain>
