<text x="7.62" y="243.84" size="3" layer="97">ROBOTRACERS 2026  |  ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8</text>
<text x="7.62" y="236.22" size="2" layer="97">USB-C / PROTECCION / DETECCION VBUS</text>
<text x="7.62" y="5.08" size="1.6" layer="97">REV A  |  2026-09-27  |  HOJA 2/2  |  BASE PARA INTEGRACION - PCB NO RUTEADA</text>
<text x="12.7" y="228.6" size="2" layer="97">04  |  USB-C DISPOSITIVO / DATOS USB 2.0</text>
<wire x1="85.66" y1="197.42" x2="87.06" y2="198.82" width="0.2" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="85.66" y1="198.82" x2="87.06" y2="197.42" width="0.2" layer="97"/>
