<wire x1="0" y1="254" x2="0" y2="0" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<text x="7.62" y="243.84" size="3" layer="97">ROBOTRACERS 2026 | POTENCIA REV D</text>
<text x="7.62" y="236.22" size="2" layer="97">3V3 ESP32 / BATERIA 2S</text>
<text x="7.62" y="5.08" size="1.5" layer="97">ESQUEMA EN INTEGRACION - VALIDAR TERMICA Y TRANSITORIOS ANTES DE PCBA</text>
<text x="17.78" y="91.44" size="1.6" layer="97">RT NC = 500 kHz. TPS62933 sin F (PFM a carga baja).</text>
<text x="17.78" y="71.12" size="1.6" layer="97">VBAT_2S: entrada de bateria protegida, 6.0...8.4 V.</text>
<text x="17.78" y="50.8" size="1.6" layer="97">3V3_MAIN alimenta ESP32 y encoders. No usar VM_6V.</text>
<text x="17.78" y="30.48" size="1.6" layer="97">C103 y C104 junto al IC; lazo SW-L-C compacto.</text>
</plain>
