<description>6V TURBINA / CORRIENTE DE CARGA PENDIENTE DE MEDIR</description>
<plain>
<wire x1="0" y1="0" x2="406.4" y2="0" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="406.4" y1="0" x2="406.4" y2="254" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="406.4" y1="254" x2="0" y2="254" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<wire x1="0" y1="254" x2="0" y2="0" width="0.254" layer="97"/>
<text x="7.62" y="243.84" size="3" layer="97">ROBOTRACERS 2026 | POTENCIA REV E</text>
<text x="7.62" y="236.22" size="2" layer="97">6V TURBINA / BUCK-BOOST INDEPENDIENTE</text>
<text x="7.62" y="5.08" size="1.5" layer="97">ESQUEMA EN INTEGRACION - VALIDAR TERMICA Y TRANSITORIOS ANTES DE PCBA</text>
<text x="17.78" y="233.68" size="1.4" layer="97">400 kHz FPWM. EXTVCC y CDC NC. VOUT = 6.019 V nominal.</text>
<text x="17.78" y="20.32" size="1.3" layer="97">UVLO: ~6.53 V ON / ~5.98 V OFF. R213=18 mOhm/1 W, C50314717; limite nominal 2.78 A. Medir arranque turbina.</text>
<text x="10" y="10" size="1.27" layer="97">U20 TPS55289: I2C 0x75; firmware configura 6V y habilita salida.</text>
</plain>
